@startuml omniflow-classes-registry
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
hide empty members
title Part 2: Function Registry (excerpt of the full class model, Appendix A)
left to right direction

class FunctionRegistryStore {
  -file : Path
  +readAll() : Map
  +tryResolveEntryIn(ref, snapshot) : Pair[0..1]
  +put(key, metadata)
  +remove(key)
}

class FunctionInvocationMetadata {
  +serviceName : String
  +url : String
}

class FunctionRegistryBootstrapper {
  +bootstrapIfMissing(scope)
}

interface CloudFunctionsCatalog {
  +listHttpFunctions(scope) : Map
}
class CloudRunV2RestCatalog
class LambdaFunctionsCatalog

FunctionRegistryStore ..> FunctionInvocationMetadata
FunctionRegistryBootstrapper --> FunctionRegistryStore
FunctionRegistryBootstrapper --> CloudFunctionsCatalog
CloudFunctionsCatalog <|.. CloudRunV2RestCatalog
CloudFunctionsCatalog <|.. LambdaFunctionsCatalog

note bottom of FunctionInvocationMetadata
  url holds an HTTPS endpoint on GCP
  and a Lambda ARN on AWS
end note
@enduml
